<title>USA: Livingston Cty, Mich., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Livingston Cty, Mich., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc said it won $2.975 million of Livingston County, Mich., joint water system limited tax bonds, Series E, with a net interest cost of 5.2963 percent.</p>
</text>
